# impeccable design-skill working files.
# Screenshots, live-mode state and build scratch are ignored; the two durable
# records are kept. Needs the **/ prefix and the /* form: a middle slash anchors
# a pattern to the repo root, and git will not descend into an excluded
# directory to apply a negation.
**/.impeccable/*
!**/.impeccable/surfaces/
!**/.impeccable/design.json
